formant copies the static-filter parser, DNR compiler, scriptlet registry and
scriptlet compiler/templates under `core/`, plus required `lib/` modules.
Filter lists are fetched at runtime from the URLs published in upstream
`assets/assets.json`. Bundled `assets/` files are offline seeds for first run
and CDN failure. The bundled AdGuard Chinese, EasyList, EasyPrivacy and other
third-party lists retain the attribution and license headers in their text.

formant-owned files in this tree:

  core/vapi-shim.js
      Empty vAPI.localStorage / canWASM=false so the compiler can load in an
      MV3 service worker.

  content/cosmetic.js
      Applies upstream compiled CSS selectors to pages.

  ../ublock-page-rules.js
      Connects compiled page rules to formant's MV3 content/userScripts APIs.

css-tree (src/lib/csstree) retains its upstream MIT license in
`lib/csstree/LICENSE`.
